  <div class="page-content">
    <h1>About Wailea Art</h1>
    <p class="lede">Wailea Art is a small print studio based in Maui, Hawaii, making original Hawaiian art available for everyday walls.</p>
    <p>Each piece starts as an original work and is reproduced as a museum-quality print, sized to fit easily in a standard frame and easy to send. Our art draws on the colors and light of the Hawaiian islands — from the resort coastline of Wailea and Kapalua, to the historic streets of Lahaina, to the energy of Honolulu and Oahu. Whether you're decorating a home in Hawaii or bringing a piece of the islands to the mainland, our prints are made to feel like Hawaii.</p>
    <p>Prints are available individually, or in bulk for shops, boutiques, vacation rentals, and gift retailers across Maui, Oahu, Kauai, and the Big Island looking for authentic Hawaii-inspired wall art at wholesale pricing.</p>
    <p>Every retail order and packaged bulk order ships with a protective plastic sleeve, a support backing board, and a white card envelope, so your print arrives ready to frame.</p>
    <p>Have a question about a piece, a custom order, or wholesale pricing for your Hawaii-based shop or business? Get in touch on the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
